## Invariants

- Edit the canonical checkout, not `{{ .decentangl.defaults.codex_home }}/`.
- Keep auth, history, caches, sqlite files, logs, and project trust local.
- Keep `config.toml` portable. Preserve runtime-managed plugins, marketplaces,
  notifications, project trust, and local model preferences.
- Put durable workflow rules in `AGENTS.md`.
- Render platform or host differences with templates. Move repeated mechanics
  into manifest-driven scripts and leave command pointers in agent guidance.

## Workflow

1. Run `decent-angl-sync status`, then edit `~/src/boilerplate/home/...`.
2. Apply targeted files with `chezmoi apply`.
3. Verify rendered files and `codex --version`, then publish through
   `decent-angl-sync reconcile`.
